<h1>Reset your Grindfolio password</h1>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your Grindfolio account.</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Choose a new password", password_reset_url(token: @reset_token) %>
</p>

<p>This link expires in one hour. If you did not request a password reset, you can ignore this email.</p>
